[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10322.469, "timestamp": "02:52:02", "text": "嗯。是的。嗯，这就是我玩得开心的地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10325.11, "timestamp": "02:52:05", "text": "聊天。其实我玩游戏玩得很开心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10327.51, "timestamp": "02:52:07", "text": "挺酷的。是的。加上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10331.59, "timestamp": "02:52:11", "text": "此处填写姓名首字母。那也挺好的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10334.15, "timestamp": "02:52:14", "text": "是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10342.55, "timestamp": "02:52:22", "text": "那么，我们后会有期。我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10345.75, "timestamp": "02:52:25", "text": "你已经焕然一新了，伙计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10350.07, "timestamp": "02:52:30", "text": "我是。是的。是的。你听起来 你听起来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10354.11, "timestamp": "02:52:34", "text": "迫不及待想看直播了。嘿，我准备好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10357.99, "timestamp": "02:52:37", "text": "D. 我准备好了。准备好了，伙计们。好的，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10362.15, "timestamp": "02:52:42", "text": "回头见，伙计。你好。再见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10365.269, "timestamp": "02:52:45", "text": "保重，好好休息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10374.91, "timestamp": "02:52:54", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10379.469, "timestamp": "02:52:59", "text": "再见。所以，那就是布拉德，我们唯一的……"}]